# CyWee CWSTM32 sensor hub
#

config IIO_CWSTM32
	tristate "CyWee CWSTM32 sensor hub"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Say yes here to build support for the CyWee STM32 sensor hub found
	  on the ZTE Blade S6, which aggregates accelerometer, gyroscope,
	  magnetometer, ambient light and proximity sensors behind an I2C
	  register protocol and exposes them as IIO channels.
